      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那就告诉我一件事。/n初魅姐在戏剧上追求的，到底是什么？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20018080290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2001808033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我个人的目标？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20018080300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2001808034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我想知道，好方便以后超越初魅姐。/n你有“想成为Dai Star”之类的梦想吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20018080310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2001808035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "创造能治愈观众灵魂饥渴的戏，仅此而已。/n我对头衔和名誉都没兴趣。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20018080320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2001808036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "Dai Star的演出会得到所有人的关注。/n有总比没有好吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20018080330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2001808037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "确实能吸引观众。对剧团的发展也很重要。/n时雨是在追求更高处吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20018080340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2001808038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "演员不都这样吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20018080350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2001808039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2001808,
